 "name": "Commander Zilyana",
 "wikiUrl": "https://oldschool.runescape.wiki/w/Commander_Zilyana",
 "overview": [
  "Like other God Wars Dungeon bosses, Zilyana roams around a rectangular room with her bodyguards until a player enters, attacking them on sight. While she has a significantly lower max hit than the other generals, she makes up for it with extremely fast and accurate attacks, and her bodyguards use a different combat style each. She will only use her magic attacks at melee distance, which has a minimum hit of 10 should it successfully hit the player. If all players leave, her health and stats will be reset.",
  "*Starlight (Melee) *Bree (Ranged) *Growler (Magic)"
